@startuml act_kpi_recompute
title Activity Diagram: KPI Computation

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #D6E4F0
skinparam activityBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam activityFontName Helvetica
skinparam activityFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

start

:Triggering event\n(workload entry, milestone change,\nmission or amendment added);

note right : Recomputation is automatic\nafter any change affecting\ncost or billing.

:Load the project's data\n(TCC, planned workload,\nactual workload, billing milestones, missions);

:Compute the actual labor cost\n(Σ actual days × resource's daily rate);

:Compute other incurred costs\n(missions, travel, sundry expenses);

:Estimate the final project cost (EAC)\n(actual costs + estimate of remaining costs);

if (EAC > initial budget?) then (yes)
  :Flag the budget drift;
  note right : Visible immediately\non the dashboard.
else (no)
  :Compute the projected margin\n((Budget − EAC) / Budget);
endif

:Compute billing progress\n(invoiced amount / total budget);

:Update the project's KPI dashboard\n(margin, estimated final cost, remaining budget,\nbilling progress);

stop

@enduml
